OL,15,G0932 The Food Chain
OL,16,     FThe price of food is rising. But
OL,17,     Fwhy? Rumella Dasgupta looks at
OL,18,     Fsomething we're all encouraged to
OL,19,     Feat more of - fruit and vegetables
OL,20,     F- and asks why they're now costing
OL,21,     Fus more.
